---
/**
 * SuccessSection — paint the win. SB7: Success. PEACE: C + E.
 */
---

<section class="section bg-cumberland-cream">
  <div class="container-rail max-w-4xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Imagine this</p>
    <h2 class="mt-4 text-cumberland-ink">Here's what done-right looks like.</h2>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-cumberland-ink">
      <p>
        The team runs out of the tunnel in matching, sharp, <em>real</em>
        uniforms. Phones come out. Photos go up.
      </p>
      <p>
        The new sign goes up over your shop and your friends text you photos.
        <em>"Saw your sign — looks awesome."</em>
      </p>
      <p>
        Your work truck rolls into a job site and the homeowner says, "I've
        seen you guys around — y'all do good work, right?"
      </p>
      <p>
        The pastor emails: <em>"Got the shirts. The kids LOVE them. Thank y'all."</em>
      </p>
      <p class="font-display text-2xl text-cumberland-forest leading-tight pt-4">
        That's what 23 years of doing this gets you. That's the standard at
        Cumberland Signworks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="/start-your-project" class="btn-primary text-base md:text-lg">
        Start Your Project
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
